  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Ported the plate-center thread-count compatibility overload and single/all-corners plate-force queries with task variants and complete matching XML IntelliSense. Added source-based named corner result, immutable key and indexed result-set models plus optional plate incidence metadata. Qualified Boolean force success, integral-zero incidence success and documented-void coordinate outputs with complete written finite buffers. Preserved captured request identities, first-incidence order, duplicate-ID handling and owning-thread execution without partial result sets or worker COM. Forty-five Output contracts are available; see the plate-corner guide.",
